section: ghc-lib
synopsis: Deprecate `doMkDependHS` in favour of `doMkDepend`
issues: #27938
mrs: !16717
description: {
    Deprecate `doMkDependHS` in favour of the more expressive `doMkDepend`
    in order to better support multiple home units.

    For migration, initialise the session using `initMkDepend`, set the obtained targets
    via `setTargets` and then use the new API `doMkDepend`.
}
